{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2023-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1701993600, "end_date": 1702684799, "month_true_total": 2536, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:05:44 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "153676154", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038262067", "personaname": "[ROT]RavinRed", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198038262067/", "num_games_owned": 111, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 92407, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 68599, "last_played": 1786982122, "avatar": "664c93bdfff4dd05eee383cea16a14356ad4de12"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly playing as a human warframe brought me back to this game, loving play Nyx human form, hope they continue releasing more and ignore the gaters that are swearing they should discontinue the 1999 content.\n\n1999 was the first time ive played a story mode and felt something.... \n\n===spoiler==============\n\nbut you grow attached to them pretty fast since theyre all humans that speak coherently and not in annoying riddles like every other story mission, and when they start dying one by one especally Mag... it hit kinda hard, first time i've felt some kind of emotion in this game, seriously they need to allow us to play in the cities and put more content in this era, this was the best story mission i've played thus far.. i actually paid attention and didnt skip everything", "timestamp_created": 1702684202, "timestamp_updated": 1748324660, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.449826985597610474", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153675627", "author": {"steamid": "76561199389032257", "personaname": "Farrow", "persona