29"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is one of the greatest free to play games of all time, being a super space ninja with epic powers is awesome! Also that everything in the game is obtainable within the game (it's a lot of grinding but it's doable), including the premium currency, through trading with other players, that is the major difference it has from other free to play games with micro/macro transactions as far as I've seen this is the only one that has that option, I might be wrong about other free to play games but, it's the only free to play game I've played that has that kind of trading in it. Which is a great feature include in the trading system!", "timestamp_created": 1702680519, "timestamp_updated": 1702680519, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153672993", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014748232", "personaname": "Cannibble", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nibblenibblenibble/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 144690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 98887, "last_played": 1779862353, "avatar": "d8f3b9eeb075b898cef6dec217b8b0544ece96d6"}, "language": "english", "review": "combo movement? \n\nShooty and looty?\n\ntenouttaten mate", "timestamp_created": 1702680222, "timestamp_updated": 1702680222, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}